{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(a_bit_easier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (a bit easier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Straightforward)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Straightforward)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the consumer, a single discount of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b541dad22678604857853a22a0116f606f98fe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> is more advantageous than any of the following discounts:\n</p><p>(1) two successive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/a/87a8787ca8fcdf64f42e938d20fa64f63871646d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />  discounts\n</p><p>(2) three successive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> discounts\n</p><p>(3) a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> discount followed by a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbf33b81900fa9e836a608be7484b4c4d6ea3ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" /> discount\n</p><p>What is the smallest possible positive integer value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/f/55f5490929c67ceb91699f74362699136012ffbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\ 27\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 28\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 29\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 31\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"399\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the original price be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then, for option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the discounted price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/3/9931b3325d2a93f7e4ffa98b11e31694b9fc1014.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-.15)(1-.15)x = .7225x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"223\" height=\"18\" />. For option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the discounted price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4a6c88e41f5c9e24046ca43e2619393137790f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-.1)(1-.1)(1-.1)x = .729x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"255\" height=\"18\" />. Finally, for option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the discounted price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad7d8717b0fb909896e25f274343beb054a1e453.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-.25)(1-.05) = .7125x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/e/a8e325234dd23db5adccfa1f501d700c19003cd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max(x - .7225x, x-.729x, x-.7125x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"310\" height=\"20\" />. It follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/a/cbab8456e0c981b4c458623b4f8ce7e6334176a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n/100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" /> must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f10c71e7d27bba42777221b4540cbcaca0dd387.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.2875$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. We multiply this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> to get the percent value, and then round up because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is the smallest integer that provides a greater discount than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/1/3c1694abbbf2ecd583a1b4b06a8a701eccc6e2b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28.75$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, leaving us with the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee346cac45bd4de313dd1ad479560253a2cd589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28a_bit_easier.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(a_bit_easier)\">Solution 2 (a bit easier)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (a bit easier)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume the original price was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. Thus, after a discount of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b541dad22678604857853a22a0116f606f98fe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, the price will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64314bce34c5cfec48841083b38af9459ba7b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> dollars. Using basic calculations, find out the value of the other discounts. This leaves us with the prices: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64314bce34c5cfec48841083b38af9459ba7b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/d/fedbad111ab5056c062477becf70eadd98199079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{289}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5b0c95965c92e357dead5e2c96200ac00a7130.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9^3}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"39\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/154b7a0ad6c4a31f0703899ea002f61483592539.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{15\\cdot19}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"51\" height=\"38\" />. Simplify these to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b64314bce34c5cfec48841083b38af9459ba7b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-n$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> (rounded down), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/a/b8a38da5766e645a8bb912ff1c69022609ae7459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72.9$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (rounded down). To have the greatest discount, we need the least price, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. Now we get the original fractional value of this, and the discount of this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3aaf75bef47d462172723673c64dc54ddc357ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-\\frac{285}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"38\" />, and we round this down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Now, it's pretty easy. The integer value greater than this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee346cac45bd4de313dd1ad479560253a2cd589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~solution by sakshamsethi\n</p><p>~edited by sosiaops\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Straightforward.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Straightforward)\">Solution 3 (Straightforward)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Straightforward)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume WLOG that the original price was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />. Then, option 1 would cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7ecd2e0d07dcf7d4abb8f3df2382acdb9924610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot \\frac{17}{20} \\cdot \\frac{17}{20} = \\$ 72.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"174\" height=\"38\" />. Option 2 would cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/7/d37c01b823759df1fc3c692760ae749a0d03c488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot \\frac{9}{10} \\cdot \\frac{9}{10} \\cdot \\frac{9}{10} = \\$72.90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"210\" height=\"38\" />. Option 3 would cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/8/7f842cef59b5c33d5e9718a22862e7307cdd42a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\cdot \\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{19}{20} = \\$71.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"165\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, the largest integer smaller than all of these three is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2daa52abc74576c9d34bef722d9d4ce554b5883d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-71= \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 29}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"158\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MrThinker\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TVk6fRdTFJU\">https://youtu.be/TVk6fRdTFJU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B\">2014 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017233544\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 319/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7830/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.508      1 -total\n 60.12%    8.121      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.82%    5.244      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:12382:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017233544 and revision id 196809. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}